  "description": "29 Detroit rules (21 LUPUS, 2+2 ONCOLOGY/TESTRES, 1 BIOIVTONC, 3 SHORTFORM death fields) tested a value that is not a choice on the controlling list, so the fields could never appear. Each is repointed at the choice whose label names the same thing. Generated from docs/BIOIVT_BROKEN_RULES_PROPOSED_FIXES.csv.",
  "rationale": "Found 2026-10-04 by comparing every rule against real choice names. The wrong values are leftovers of a lab-test list (TESTED, CMP, PT_INR, PSA) applied in choice order. Every proposed value verified to exist as a choice. Approved by Dan 2026-10-04 (death fields approved earlier the same day).",
